cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GLPI MCP Server"
abstract: "MCP server for GLPI 11.0.6+ and 12 (IT service management) over the High-Level API: tickets, changes and problems with their timeline and team, assets, users, groups, entities, the knowledge base, documents and generic access to every endpoint. OAuth password grant, per-user token passthrough or GLPI/OIDC login; read-only and dry-run modes, tag-based tool filtering and rate limiting."
authors:
